 is.
 The color scheme: the 16 basic colors, the default text and background colors, and the cursor and
 selection colors. The value names a built-in palette, `custom`, which takes the colors from the
 `palette-*` keys, or a file `NAME.palette` in `/etc/vtium/palettes` or
 `/usr/share/vtium/palettes`. A look's own `palette` wins. A palette file uses Ghostty's theme …






